   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I liked it",
     "texto": [
      "**Понравился** (liked, masculine) and **понравилась** (liked, feminine) are the perfective past of **понравиться**: they agree with what was liked: **Мне понравился фильм** («I liked the film»), **Мне понравилась книга** («I liked the book»), **Мне понравились фильмы** («I liked the films»).",
      "**Нравиться** is the present or everyday form; **понравиться** is what you liked on one occasion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Based on...",
     "texto": [
      "**Снят** («filmed, shot») is the short form of the passive participle (B1, chapter 26): **фильм снят по роману** («the film is based on a novel»). **По** + dative indicates the source: **по роману**.",
      "The plot is **сюжет**; the director, **режиссёр**; the actor, **актёр**; the spectator, **зритель**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
